        "en": "Creative fidelity is man's living response to the inconstancy of time. It holds fast through the tempests of weariness and doubt, attesting that the pledged promise possesses eternal worth. This spiritual victory over the vertigo of doubt attests the indestructible fecundity of invocation and grace (Part II, §65)."
