        "en": "To recover authentic humanity is to restore the capacity for adoration and wonder. The man who no longer knows how to marvel before the gratuitous gift of existence is already spiritually dead. This spiritual victory over the vertigo of doubt attests the indestructible fecundity of invocation and grace (Part II, §91)."
